'''BattleAxe II '''is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 100th tier in the Main Event during the [[Halloween Event 2018|2018 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Battleaxe II’s blade appears to represent a bird with a purple gemstone on its stomach. The handle has a purple paracord wrap, along with a small bat on the belly, and a black mace with purple spikes located on the knob of the axe

==Trivia==

* Its model derives from the Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/2409286506/Bat-tle-Axe Bat-tle Axe], purchasable from the avatar shop for 500 Robux. However, the texture has been altered to a different color scheme.
* It is the sequel to the [[BattleAxe]].
* When salvaged, it provides 90 godly [[shards]].
* This, [[Candy]], [[BattleAxe]], [[Bat]], [[Turkey]], [[Evergreen]], [[Heart Wand]], and [[Embersickle]] are the only godly "[[knives]]" that do not resemble knives.
